-DATASET CSV empty
--

-CASE CommutePathP3
-LOAD_DYNAMIC_EXTENSION algo
-STATEMENT CREATE NODE TABLE N(id INT64 PRIMARY KEY)
---- ok
-STATEMENT CREATE REL TABLE E(FROM N TO N)
---- ok
-STATEMENT CREATE (:N {id:0}),(:N {id:1}),(:N {id:2})
---- ok
-STATEMENT MATCH (x:N {id:0}),(y:N {id:1}) CREATE (x)-[:E]->(y)
---- ok
-STATEMENT MATCH (x:N {id:1}),(y:N {id:2}) CREATE (x)-[:E]->(y)
---- ok
-STATEMENT CALL PROJECT_GRAPH('G', ['N'], ['E'])
---- ok
-STATEMENT CALL commute_time_distance('G', 0, 2) RETURN source, target, distance
---- 1
0|2|4.000000

-CASE CommuteDisconnected
-LOAD_DYNAMIC_EXTENSION algo
-STATEMENT CREATE NODE TABLE N(id INT64 PRIMARY KEY)
---- ok
-STATEMENT CREATE REL TABLE E(FROM N TO N)
---- ok
-STATEMENT CREATE (:N {id:0}),(:N {id:1})
---- ok
-STATEMENT CALL PROJECT_GRAPH('G', ['N'], ['E'])
---- ok
-STATEMENT CALL commute_time_distance('G', 0, 1) RETURN source, target, distance
---- error
Binder exception: COMMUTE_TIME_DISTANCE requires source and target in the same connected component (graph is disconnected).
